### Electrical 1: normal
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "dadef783-36e2-4628-880d-7e02c9bfe885", "value": { "watts": 100 } }

### Electrical 2: normal
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "dadef783-36e2-4628-880d-7e02c9bfe885", "value": { "watts": 200 } }

### Electrical 3: normal
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "dadef783-36e2-4628-880d-7e02c9bfe885", "value": { "watts": 300 } }

### Electrical 4: SPIKE (critical, over 5000)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "dadef783-36e2-4628-880d-7e02c9bfe885", "value": { "watts": 6000 } }

### Ingestion status
GET http://localhost:5056/ingestion/status

### Pause
POST http://localhost:5056/ingestion/pause

### Resume
POST http://localhost:5056/ingestion/resume

### Read what reached the store
GET http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
###

